 L.procedure.push('B56 SOURCE TRANSFER. In simulation only, compare a 50 kHz 3 Vpeak output with a 0.94 V/µs minimum slope; check both an explicitly selected GBW model and the separately specified slew-rate limit. A generic ideal simulator op amp may not model finite slew or bandwidth—state that absence rather than claiming a hardware pass.');
